\item \code{yaw} and \code{light_azimuth}: a full turn, \code{c(0, 360)}.
\item \code{roll}: \code{c(-90, 0)}, from a side view to looking straight down.
\item \code{pitch}: \code{c(-45, 45)}.
\item \code{light_elevation}: \code{c(0, 90)}, from the horizon to overhead.
